<title>USA: Farallon group lifts Strawbridge stake.</title>
<headline>Farallon group lifts Strawbridge stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Farallon Capital Management L.L.C. said Thursday it raised its stake in Strawbridge &amp; Clother to 9.5 percent or 1,007,200 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 182,300 additional shares of Strawbridge between August 1 and September 18 at prices ranging from $17.50 to $19.50 a share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake in Strawbridge for investment purposes.</p>
